<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2823" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰώρα</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀείρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>swing, hammock, chariot on springs</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				789d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>noose, halter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1264
			</span></i> (in the form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐώρα</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>oscillatory movement, see-saw, pulsation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				111e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.47
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic.,
				<i>passive exercise</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.793b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.125
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.955
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰ. ψυχῆς</span>
			<i>fluctuation</i> of mind, <i><span class="en">
				Metrod.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				831.8
			</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				434
			</span></i>).</div>
